Implement click-drag across drum pads in plugin_gui.c.

Allow holding mouse button and dragging across drum grid cells to toggle
multiple steps in one gesture, like painting.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Mouse down on a pad sets the "paint mode" (toggle on or off based on first cell)
- [ ] Dragging across pads applies same toggle to all crossed cells
- [ ] Mouse up ends paint gesture
- [ ] Works in both plugin and standalone GUI

## Test Plan
- [ ] Click-drag across a row, verify all crossed cells toggled
- [ ] Click-drag on active cells, verify all turned off
- [ ] Rapid drag across full row, verify no missed cells
